        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>general or unspecified; prefer specifics; <a id='genet' class='textLink_genet' href='/record/ui?ui=Q000235'>/&zwnj;genet</a>: consider also <a href="/record/ui?ui=D020271" class="textLink_HEREDODEGENERATIVEDISORDERSNERVOUSSYSTEM">HEREDODEGENERATIVE DISORDERS, NERVOUS SYSTEM</a></dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Hereditary and sporadic conditions which are characterized by progressive nervous system dysfunction. These disorders are often associated with atrophy of the affected central or peripheral nervous system structures.</dd>
                </span>
            
            <dt>Entry Version</dt><dd>NEURODEGENERATIVE DIS</dd>
        
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
